# The only Docker build is the server's (server/Dockerfile), with the repo root
# as its context. Send it exactly what it copies, and never a secret: a local
# `docker build` would otherwise carry a working tree's .env into the image.
*
!server/
!extension/content.js
server/.env
server/.env.*
server/data/
server/node_modules/
server/release.json
